 also work with Macs as the other computer. GitLama recognizes whether it is a Linux PC or a Mac and installs the matching helper.","Experimental remote workspaces: create, rename, delete and switch branches, manage tags, upstreams and remotes, use stashes, and fetch, pull or push on the other computer. Fetch, pull and push sign in with the credentials set up on that computer. If GitLama cannot confirm whether a change was applied, it lists it under Remote changes instead of trying again.","Fixed: adding a remote host from a new tab failed with \"The host could not be saved\". Settings changes made while a new tab is open are now saved as well.","When a remote host cannot be saved, GitLama now tells you why and shows an error code you can report.","Fixed: remote URLs such as `git@github.com:owner/repo.git` show their SSH login instead of `[REDACTED]`.","Fixed: Edit remote can no longer replace a remote's URL with a hidden placeholder. When the current URL contains a password or token, the field starts empty and asks for the complete new URL."],"tag":"v0.1.0-beta.37-38","version":"0.1.0-beta.37"},{"assets":[{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":18184696,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.36-37-linux-x86_64.AppImage","format":"AppImage","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"545c0d74ae8d5a82251a32911f18de6321fe863e1ae8a347b979f41b8f24a604","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.36-37/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.36-37-linux-x86_64.AppImage"},{"architecture":"x86_64","bytes":18814252,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.36-37-linux-x86_64.tar.gz","format":"tar.gz","minimum_system":"glibc 2.35 and Git 2.39","platform":"linux","sha256":"8b5861de161b69e1f4b0771458f0592833c9a91adc71d9215f44bd60999c9435","url":"https://github.com/devmil/gitlama/releases/download/v0.1.0-beta.36-37/GitLama-0.1.0-beta.36-37-linux-x86_64.tar.gz"},{"architecture":"arm64","bytes":20182406,"file":"GitLama-0.1.0-beta.36-37-macos-arm64.dmg","format":"dmg","minimum_sys